	<meta name="description" content="Located in Tokyo’s neighboring Kanagawa Prefecture, Kamakura is a popular tourist destination rich in history, culture, and nature. It is about a one-hour train ride from Tokyo or about 40 minutes from Shin-Yokohama Station, the nearest Shinkansen stop. It is also accessible from Haneda Airport.">

