<div id="transp-in-kamakura" class="p-access-transp js-target-contents">
<h2 class="p-access-transp__ttl is-fade js-fade-anime">Public transportation in Kamakura city</h2>
<p class="p-access-transp__txt is-fade js-fade-anime">The JR and Enoden trains as well as Shonan monorail, buses, and taxis are its main forms of public transportation. Please be aware in advance that at unmanned stations, the way to ride a train may be different from that of a normal train.</p>

<div class="p-access-transp__btn is-fade js-fade-anime"><a class="c-btn-primary" href="/transportation/">
<span class="c-btn-primary__text">Explore Transportation</span></a>&nbsp;

</div>
</div>

<div id="about-free-passes" class="p-access-transp js-target-contents">
<h2 class="p-access-transp__ttl is-fade js-fade-anime">About free passes for transportation</h2>
<p class="p-access-transp__txt is-fade js-fade-anime">Kamakura has various convenient and affordable free passes, so be sure to check them in advance.</p>

<div class="p-access-transp__btn is-fade js-fade-anime">
              <a href="https://visit.trip-kamakura.com/transportation/unlimited-ride-transit-passes/" class="c-btn-primary">
<span class="c-btn-primary__text">Explore Travel service “Free Pass”</span>
<span class="c-btn-primary__icon" aria-hidden="true" role="img"></span>
</a></div>
</div>


</div>
</div>
</div>
