      <p class="c-travel-guidance__lead">If you come all the way to Kamakura, we want you to have a pleasant, relaxing, and enjoyable trip! Please keep in mind the tourism etiquette that respects people, the town, and its culture, and have a memorable and fun trip to Kamakura.</p>
